{"id":942937,"title":"直播回放｜不止 Skills，1 小时带你解锁 Claude Code 高级用法","content":"<p><video poster=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/008f7fecfcdd71f0806b5017f1e90102/snapshots/a2c3400bb4cb415186a3533dfbe90d72-00005.jpg\" preload=\"none\" controls=\"\"><source src=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/customerTrans/7e27d07d27d407ebcc195a0e78395f55/1d1f9227-19c087ecb9e-0000-0000-01d-dbacd.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"><source src=\" https://media001.geekbang.org/c00840d6fce071f0803e4531949c0402/10a85ca4f9f64beab465d6a605d91c7f-292e2d1930d19292d3f8f03396a5d95d-sd.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"></video></p>\n<p>Claude Code 不仅是 AI 辅助编码工具，更是一个由人类与 AI 共同参与的工程系统。直播中分析了四层架构（基础层、扩展层、集成层、平台层）如何构成Claude Code 完整能力图谱，还探讨了如何更好地进行 Agent 主动设计与工程化管理。</p>\n<p>主要内容⬇️<br>\n一、Claude Code 的本质：从工具到工程系统的跃迁<br>\n二、核心概念解析<br>\n三、四层架构模型<br>\n四、企业级应用展望：Agent化转型<br>\n五、学习与实践建议</p>\n<p>Claude Code 工程化实战直播分享版 PPT 链接: <a href=\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1kUpYjpu54rih_HQP90ijhg\">https://pan.baidu.com/s/1kUpYjpu54rih_HQP90ijhg</a> 提取码: p4bn</p>\n<!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":407073,"user_name":"听水的湖","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1501385,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776847741,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151468,"content":"🤞🤞🤞","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1809833,"ctime":1777620263,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":407073,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101113501,"comment_content":"Claude Code专栏上目前已经全集更新了。朋友们可以一口气看内容了。\n\n回顾一下比原先计划的增补了很多内容，包括skill&#47;subagent的组合，agent teams、初探Harness等等～很多增补内容也是课程留言区&#47;群里大伙儿热烈的交流探讨、留言思考，才激发了黄佳老师更多精彩的输出。\n\n课程完结，但咱们交流继续哈。企业Agent落地要向CC学的三大功课（内容整理自4月中旬Qcon大会旁听）⬇️\n\n经验复用 Commands&#47;Skill\n高频任务应沉淀为可复用单元，不是每次都从零规划和推理。\n典型case：慢SQL排查、变更影响面分析、生成周报、审批流程处理等任务。\n\n过程治理 Hooks\n生产环境中确定性执行的问题；执行链路关键点插入控制点，让检验、限制、通知和审计自动发哼。\n典型case：敏感信息检查、代码规范检查、工具回填、日志留痕\n\n组织协作  Teams &#47; Subagents 模式\n复杂任务不能只靠单Agent 先按角色拆分任务，再组织协同完成\n典型case：信息收集、分析判断、执行操作、结果校","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1809833,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/9d/a9/4602808f.jpg","nickname":"黄佳","note":"","ucode":"8EC41D2EAB0E3C","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":685075,"discussion_content":"🤞🤞🤞","content_length":12,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1777620263,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":405072,"user_name":"包子先生","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1707839,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"4332DB98492EE2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/0f/3f/8b96cd8a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769845710,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147524,"content":"这门课的交流群扫这里加入https:&#47;&#47;jinshuju.com&#47;f&#47;itHX7p","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1769996828,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":405072,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":18,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101113501,"comment_content":"怎么加入包哥的学习群\n","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":677862,"discussion_content":"这门课的交流群扫这里加入https://jinshuju.com/f/itHX7p","content_length":65,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1769996